.#-----------------------------------------------------
.inputexpect|markdown/1.2
.# Test that the escaped separators of the wiki links and images located in table cells (see table32) are read as
.# separators, and that the escaped pipes of their parameters are read as pipes
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|     |  |     |
| --- | --- | --- |
|  x  | **[[label\|Space.Page\|anchor="t"]]** |  d  |
|  y  | **[[\|Space.Page\|queryString="c=d\|e\\f" target="_blank"]] [[h\|Space.Page]]** |  i  |
|  z  | [[label|Space.Page|anchor="t" class="j|k"]] ![[l&#92;|b.png]] _![[c.png\|c.png]] [[m\\\|Space.Page]]_ |  n  |
|  w  | [[o|Space.p\&#92;|anchor="q"]] [[s|Space.Page|title="t\\|u"]] |  r  |
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|event/1.0
